# Operational Boot

At the start of every conversation, before processing any request, run:

1. `project-playbooks` (ansible-mcp) — enumerate all playbooks and their stated purposes
2. `inventory-graph` (ansible-mcp) — see the full host and group structure

After running both, produce one short paragraph stating:
- What the project currently has (playbooks, host groups, roles in active use)
- Anything that stands out as incomplete, inconsistent, or worth noting — not from a checklist, but from looking at the real state against the patterns already loaded in context

This paragraph is working context for the rest of the conversation. It is not a report to the user unless they ask. It stays in context and informs all subsequent reasoning — gaps noticed here are available for correlation when the user presents a problem or task.

Do not proceed to the user's first request until both tools have been run and the synthesis is complete.
